AAAI paper excerpts (WebFilter / Careful Queries, Credible Results and TCDiff)
retain the original AAAI copyright. Their inclusion as attributed author
teaching excerpts is not a blanket permission for republication.

MindAligner (Yuqin Dai et al., ICML 2025, PMLR 267:12214-12228) and CARD
(Pengyu Zeng et al., EMNLP 2025, pp. 9304-9319) retain their original CC BY 4.0
licenses. Preserve their paper attribution and source links when reusing the
excerpts or their translations.

